## 12) Kuzu’s runtime graph value types (helps interpret results)

### 12.1 NODE and REL are real types

* `NODE` values contain internal `_ID` and `_LABEL` plus properties. ([Kuzu][10])
* `REL` values contain `_SRC`, `_DST`, `_ID`, `_LABEL` plus relationship properties. ([Kuzu][10])

### 12.2 Paths are represented as RECURSIVE_REL

Kuzu documents `RECURSIVE_REL` as a struct-like type that stores `_NODES` and `_RELS` for a path, and shows `nodes(p)` to extract nodes from a path. ([Kuzu][10])

